    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.files\nQuestion\nHello,\nI was wondering if it's possible to group empty directories, to quickly traverse these directories and have previews of the next non-empty directory.\nIs it something that can be implemented on the user end? if not, is that a feature that can be supported in mini.files ?\nThanks",
